Reviewer lens: novelty
Box: dev Chromebook, Intel i5-10210U (Comet Lake) under crosvm, HYPERVISOR flag set.
     /proc/cpuinfo flags include: arch_perfmon, pdcm, hypervisor.
     /proc/sys/kernel/perf_event_paranoid = 2
     /sys/bus/event_source/devices/ = breakpoint cpu msr power software tracepoint uprobe
     -> a vPMU IS exposed to this guest. The claim "the dev box cannot participate
        (MSR EACCES)" is true for /dev/cpu/*/msr and IRRELEVANT: perf_event_open
